---
args: { impact: InterventionImpact, linkage: ImpactLinkage, experts: ExpertReviewScope[] }
returns: QualifiedExpertRoute
---
Match the affected taxa or ecological system to the supplied expert's documented qualification scope and current availability. Return assigned only when a current expert covers this specific effect. If the impact system is unclear, request identification first; if experts are unavailable, preserve an open expert-review task. Never infer credentials from a title alone.
